        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/j/5e9695/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2016-03-15T13:53:27.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Don't forget Fanatic's \"Chastise\".&nbsp; The re-printing of that card&nbsp;added the word&nbsp;\"non-hero\"&nbsp;to it, which drastically reigned in (in a good way)&nbsp;the possibilities of that card.</p><p>\"Solar Flare\" (2x)&nbsp;is&nbsp;in Ra's deck.&nbsp;</p><p>\"Pushing The Limits\" (3x)&nbsp;is in Tachyon's deck.&nbsp;</p><p>\"Embolden\" (2x)&nbsp;and \"Chastise\" (2x)&nbsp;are in Fanatic's deck.</p>",
