        "created_at": "2016-03-15T14:58:20.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>@UXM266: The third printing box exists.&nbsp; I found it at my FLGS a few days ago&nbsp;on Saturday.&nbsp; It says \"Third Printing\" near the barcode on the front of the box and I believe the copyright year on the back of the box was 2016 (might be 2015, but I really think it was 2016).</p>",
