        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/jffdougan/{size}/1882_2.png",
        "created_at": "2016-03-15T17:18:16.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"mwc146\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n mwc146:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Wasn't there also errata for Wrest the Mind and Rampaging T. Rex? I seem to remember hearing that Wrest the Mind had its damage bumped up and \"Non-character card\" added, while the T. Rex's text had \"besides itself\" added to its targeting.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Those are changes made going from the \"first edition\" to the \"Enhanced Edition\". The latter is the only thing commercially available now; the former had flimsier cardstock &amp; no real way to fit decks back into the box after getting opened.</p>",
